100
00:02:49,947 --> 00:02:51,707
The Kingdom Founding Festival...

101
00:02:51,707 --> 00:02:55,317
It's been five years since
 this kingdom was founded.

102
00:02:56,987 --> 00:02:58,467
Miss Lisha?

103
00:02:59,367 --> 00:03:02,417
Uh... Well, um...

104
00:03:02,417 --> 00:03:04,257
About the festival...

105
00:03:04,257 --> 00:03:09,257
Lux, do you want to go on
 a date with me at the festival?

106
00:03:10,037 --> 00:03:11,127
Hold it right there!

107
00:03:12,037 --> 00:03:17,617
Our captain also wanted to use this opportunity
 to get to know our new member, Lux, a bit better.

108
00:03:17,617 --> 00:03:18,387
H-Huh?!

109
00:03:18,387 --> 00:03:19,677
What are you saying?!

110
00:03:21,667 --> 00:03:23,897
I want to go on a date too, then.

111
00:03:23,897 --> 00:03:24,977
Phi!

112
00:03:24,977 --> 00:03:26,507
H-Hold on, all of you!

113
00:03:26,507 --> 00:03:28,727
Lux will be going to the festival with me!

114
00:03:30,467 --> 00:03:35,197
Jeez, everyone... Why are you all on edge all of a sudden?

115
00:03:35,577 --> 00:03:38,457
How cruel of you not to grasp the situation.

116
00:03:38,907 --> 00:03:40,117
All right, then,

117
00:03:40,577 --> 00:03:44,877
how about we have Lux select three girls he thinks 
did particularly well at the training camp,

118
00:03:44,877 --> 00:03:48,097
and take them on dates as a reward?

119
00:03:48,097 --> 00:03:49,587
How does that make sense?!

120
00:03:49,587 --> 00:03:51,797
It'll stir things up a bit.

121
00:03:51,797 --> 00:03:56,797
If they know it could lead to such opportunities, the girls will try even harder to do well.

122
00:03:56,797 --> 00:03:58,357
B-But...

123
00:03:58,357 --> 00:04:02,247
Hurry up and make your picks.
 Everyone's waiting.

124
00:04:03,457 --> 00:04:04,767
Come on, Lux!

125
00:04:05,277 --> 00:04:08,227
Who are you going to pick?!

126
00:04:08,857 --> 00:04:10,027
Uh...

127
00:04:10,027 --> 00:04:12,677
A-All right, then...

128
00:04:12,677 --> 00:04:14,117
Um...

129
00:04:18,657 --> 00:04:23,607
We passed by several nobles going towards the academy. What's that about?

130
00:04:23,607 --> 00:04:26,747
Oh, right, you wouldn't know.

131
00:04:26,747 --> 00:04:30,587
The All Dragons Battle will be held during the festival.

132
00:04:30,587 --> 00:04:32,507
That's what the nobles are here for.

133
00:04:32,507 --> 00:04:34,377
All Dragons Battle?

134
00:04:34,377 --> 00:04:36,467
The Machine Dragon combat tournament

135
00:04:36,467 --> 00:04:40,717
where representatives of all kingdoms compete for ruins exploration rights.

136
00:04:41,167 --> 00:04:45,937
And by the way, our knight squadron,
 you included, will be representing our kingdom.

137
00:04:45,937 --> 00:04:46,577
What?!

138
00:04:46,577 --> 00:04:47,227
Really?!

139
00:04:47,227 --> 00:04:50,777
But although you may be back on your feet,

140
00:04:50,777 --> 00:04:54,017
you're still not ready for combat.

141
00:04:54,017 --> 00:04:57,197
I'd prefer that you don't strain yourself just yet.

142
00:04:58,407 --> 00:05:01,737
Also, I have to warn you about something.

143
00:05:01,737 --> 00:05:06,747
I heard that the Empire's Dagger,
 who was imprisoned in the capital, has escaped.

144
00:05:06,747 --> 00:05:08,787
The Empire's Dagger?

145
00:05:08,787 --> 00:05:10,167
Wasn't that...

146
00:05:10,557 --> 00:05:15,487
The strongest Drag-Knight employed by
 the imperial family of the former empire.

147
00:05:15,487 --> 00:05:19,507
The report said she's coming after you,
 the one who felled the empire.

148
00:05:19,507 --> 00:05:22,727
Please be very careful.

149
00:05:22,727 --> 00:05:26,727
Don't get yourself killed after
 getting too carried away dating.

150
00:05:27,097 --> 00:05:27,727
Huh?

151
00:05:29,687 --> 00:05:31,767
Over here!

152
00:05:35,377 --> 00:05:38,187
Wh-What do you think, Lux?

153
00:05:38,187 --> 00:05:40,687
U-Um... I...

154
00:05:40,687 --> 00:05:42,687
That's our Celes!

155
00:05:42,687 --> 00:05:44,327
Lux is just smitten by your looks!

156
00:05:44,697 --> 00:05:48,167
Why did I have to change as well?

157
00:05:48,167 --> 00:05:49,947
Yes. It suits you well.

158
00:05:49,947 --> 00:05:53,487
Well, you see, I thought it would set a bad example

159
00:05:53,487 --> 00:05:57,047
for the captain of the squadron to do leisurely activities right before the All Dragons Battle.

160
00:05:57,047 --> 00:06:01,317
If you dress up, the students 
won't recognize you.

161
00:06:01,317 --> 00:06:04,527
You two will look like a young noble lady and her butler.

162
00:06:04,527 --> 00:06:07,267
Don't we look even more
 conspicuous in these clothes?

163
00:06:07,267 --> 00:06:11,397
But with this, I'll be able to experience the festival for the first time.

164
00:06:13,457 --> 00:06:17,107
N-No! I'm not excited about this at all!

165
00:06:20,407 --> 00:06:22,117
All right.

166
00:06:22,117 --> 00:06:25,157
Let's go, milady.

167
00:06:34,787 --> 00:06:37,087
I'm still dizzy.

168
00:06:37,447 --> 00:06:43,237
To drink alcohol by mistake like that,
 I guess even you can be careless sometimes.

169
00:06:44,137 --> 00:06:47,807
Still, I'm happy I was able to see the festival.

170
00:06:48,467 --> 00:06:50,597
You're amazing.

171
00:06:50,597 --> 00:06:51,567
Huh?

172
00:06:51,567 --> 00:06:56,387
You're the only boy in the whole school,
 but everyone likes being around you.

173
00:06:56,387 --> 00:07:01,227
Unlike me, who most of the students fear and avoid.

174
00:07:01,227 --> 00:07:02,407
That's not true.

175
00:07:02,927 --> 00:07:07,917
I have to rely on everyone for so much.

176
00:07:08,997 --> 00:07:11,967
But I can't fall behind!

177
00:07:11,967 --> 00:07:14,997
If you're fighting for your ideals,

178
00:07:14,997 --> 00:07:19,217
I, too, have to make an effort to reach mine.

179
00:07:19,547 --> 00:07:20,857
Celes...

180
00:07:20,857 --> 00:07:25,347
I'll continue to pursue the path of being an exemplary Drag-Knight for you!

181
00:07:26,007 --> 00:07:28,527
Of course. I'm counting on you.

182
00:07:30,097 --> 00:07:31,097
Celes?

183
00:07:32,917 --> 00:07:34,327
Ouch.

184
00:07:34,327 --> 00:07:36,377
Are you all right, Celes?

185
00:07:37,297 --> 00:07:42,307
Yes. I'm fine, but... your hands...

186
00:07:42,307 --> 00:07:42,657
My hands?

187
00:07:44,757 --> 00:07:47,867
Well, Luxy is one healthy young man, isn't he?

188
00:07:48,197 --> 00:07:49,997
Wh-What are you doing here?!

189
00:07:49,997 --> 00:07:52,137
It's almost time for your next date.

190
00:07:52,137 --> 00:07:54,617
Sorry to interrupt, Celes.

191
00:07:54,617 --> 00:07:57,337
You'll have to continue some other time.

192
00:07:58,127 --> 00:08:00,637
My face feels even warmer now.

193
00:08:00,637 --> 00:08:02,517
Is it because of the alcohol?

194
00:08:05,437 --> 00:08:07,747
They made me change again.

195
00:08:07,747 --> 00:08:10,677
Luxy, Luxy! There's no time to waste!

196
00:08:10,677 --> 00:08:12,277
Your next date is this way.

197
00:08:12,277 --> 00:08:14,227
Why are you three managing me?

198
00:08:18,647 --> 00:08:19,637
What's this?

199
00:08:19,637 --> 00:08:25,907
It's a social event for the nobles and Drag-Knights 
gathered for the All Dragons Battle.

200
00:08:25,907 --> 00:08:26,737
Oh?

201
00:08:29,657 --> 00:08:31,667
Good afternoon, Lux.

202
00:08:33,407 --> 00:08:35,477
May I have this dance?

203
00:08:38,447 --> 00:08:43,617
Sorry. I don't really go to
 these kinds of parties much.

204
00:08:43,617 --> 00:08:45,797
It's a simple dance.

205
00:08:45,797 --> 00:08:47,927
Just try to follow my lead.

206
00:08:48,477 --> 00:08:51,637
What do you think about my dress?

207
00:08:52,017 --> 00:08:54,437
Oh, um...

208
00:08:54,437 --> 00:08:56,627
You look very good in it.

209
00:08:56,627 --> 00:08:59,017
I thought you were a princess.

210
00:08:59,017 --> 00:09:03,997
That's high praise coming from an actual prince.

211
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:09,907
Your awkward steps were quite amusing.

212
00:09:09,907 --> 00:09:11,817
Don't laugh at me!

213
00:09:11,817 --> 00:09:14,037
I did my best!

214
00:09:14,037 --> 00:09:16,117
I'm sorry. Thank you.

215
00:09:18,317 --> 00:09:22,127
To be honest, Alterize is here for the festival.

216
00:09:22,127 --> 00:09:25,557
She's probably watching us
 from somewhere as we speak.

217
00:09:25,557 --> 00:09:26,077
Huh?!

218
00:09:26,077 --> 00:09:26,927
Since when?

219
00:09:27,337 --> 00:09:28,907
Don't worry about it.

220
00:09:28,907 --> 00:09:31,507
I think we put up a good show for her today.

221
00:09:31,507 --> 00:09:33,767
Yeah, you're right.

222
00:09:33,767 --> 00:09:37,257
But it's still not enough to completely convince her.

223
00:09:37,597 --> 00:09:42,107
So would <i>you</i> kiss <i>me</i> this time?

224
00:09:42,107 --> 00:09:43,607
What?! Here?!

225
00:09:43,607 --> 00:09:44,737
Please.

226
00:09:44,737 --> 00:09:47,197
You can just pretend to kiss me, if you'd prefer.

227
00:09:51,347 --> 00:09:53,037
A-All right...

228
00:10:00,697 --> 00:10:03,707
That was the first time you were the initiator.

229
00:10:03,707 --> 00:10:06,167
It feels quite different.

230
00:10:08,197 --> 00:10:12,287
All right, I'll go talk to Alterize. Bye.

231
00:10:14,887 --> 00:10:19,107
K-Krulcifer is as mature as ever.

232
00:10:19,107 --> 00:10:21,667
You have a formidable opponent, Celes.

233
00:10:21,667 --> 00:10:24,567
It's almost time for the last date.

234
00:10:27,277 --> 00:10:29,237
Sorry I'm late, Phi!

235
00:10:33,167 --> 00:10:34,287
What's wrong?

236
00:10:35,207 --> 00:10:37,137
N-Nothing.

237
00:10:37,137 --> 00:10:41,117
Um... You look good in that dress.

238
00:10:41,117 --> 00:10:42,747
Th-Thank you.

239
00:10:43,197 --> 00:10:45,307
Finally, the last date.

240
00:10:45,307 --> 00:10:49,087
Yes. We don't need to escort him any more.

241
00:10:49,087 --> 00:10:51,217
This is your time to shine, Phi!

242
00:10:51,217 --> 00:10:52,637
Headmistress?!

243
00:10:52,637 --> 00:10:53,967
Why are you here?!

244
00:10:59,787 --> 00:11:01,977
Are you sure this is where you want to go?

245
00:11:01,977 --> 00:11:03,767
Yeah. Have a seat.

246
00:11:04,927 --> 00:11:07,777
Are you hungry? Should I go get something?

247
00:11:07,777 --> 00:11:09,107
No. Come here.

248
00:11:11,377 --> 00:11:12,867
You should take a rest.

249
00:11:12,867 --> 00:11:15,217
I can tell you're tired.

250
00:11:15,217 --> 00:11:16,327
No, I'm not.

251
00:11:16,827 --> 00:11:19,707
You worked hard today again.

252
00:11:20,287 --> 00:11:22,287
So you have to rest.

253
00:11:23,507 --> 00:11:26,877
All right, I'll take you up on that.

254
00:11:28,887 --> 00:11:30,737
You can go to sleep.

255
00:11:30,737 --> 00:11:32,637
I'll wake you up later.

256
00:11:33,337 --> 00:11:34,497
Okay.

257
00:11:34,497 --> 00:11:35,847
Thanks.

258
00:11:36,367 --> 00:11:39,177
It made me happy.

259
00:11:39,177 --> 00:11:43,197
When you took the blame for me in court back then.

260
00:11:43,197 --> 00:11:45,367
And what you did on Ries Island.

261
00:11:45,367 --> 00:11:47,937
I did want someone to help me.

262
00:11:48,917 --> 00:11:53,157
I pretended I was fine, but you could always see through me.

263
00:11:55,057 --> 00:11:58,117
Thank you. For finding me.

264
00:11:58,527 --> 00:12:00,777
Now kiss him, Phi!

265
00:12:00,777 --> 00:12:05,077
Philuffy's going to be angry
 if she sees you, Headmistress.

266
00:12:09,537 --> 00:12:11,537
That was a good rest.

267
00:12:11,537 --> 00:12:14,007
I have to thank Phi somehow.

268
00:12:17,547 --> 00:12:19,117
You're coming home late, Lux.

269
00:12:20,937 --> 00:12:22,177
Miss Lisha?

270
00:12:23,807 --> 00:12:28,017
For goodness sake...
 Why didn't you choose me?

271
00:12:28,017 --> 00:12:31,047
S-Sorry. I, um...

272
00:12:31,047 --> 00:12:32,107
I get it.

273
00:12:32,487 --> 00:12:37,127
I know that those three did well at the training camp.

274
00:12:37,127 --> 00:12:39,207
I just had to vent.

275
00:12:40,087 --> 00:12:41,197
Forget about it.

276
00:12:41,577 --> 00:12:42,707
All right.

277
00:12:46,187 --> 00:12:47,957
More importantly,

278
00:12:47,957 --> 00:12:53,477
I've been meaning to make a personal request to you.

279
00:12:53,477 --> 00:12:55,167
What is it?

280
00:12:55,167 --> 00:12:56,697
Well...

281
00:12:56,697 --> 00:12:59,967
W-Will you...

282
00:12:59,967 --> 00:13:02,027
be my knight?

283
00:13:05,757 --> 00:13:09,037
After graduation, I'll have 
a more official business.

284
00:13:09,037 --> 00:13:13,647
People have been telling me I should
 get a personal attendant.

285
00:13:14,527 --> 00:13:19,367
You're strong, you know my secret,
 and most importantly...

286
00:13:20,427 --> 00:13:21,077
But...

287
00:13:22,697 --> 00:13:26,577
I'm a survivor of the former empire. A criminal.

288
00:13:26,577 --> 00:13:27,877
I couldn't possibly...

289
00:13:28,327 --> 00:13:34,297
I understand what you're saying,
 and what difficulties I'd be facing.

290
00:13:34,297 --> 00:13:37,147
But I'd still like you to think about it.

291
00:13:37,147 --> 00:13:39,337
That's all I ask.

292
00:13:40,747 --> 00:13:45,847
On the last day of the festival,
 I'll be giving a speech to the people.

293
00:13:45,847 --> 00:13:49,397
I'd like to introduce you 
as my personal attendant then.

294
00:13:49,797 --> 00:13:53,397
So give me an answer before then.

295
00:13:59,997 --> 00:14:03,607
Do I really have the right to?

296
00:14:13,857 --> 00:14:16,127
So you're taking part in training sessions starting today?

297
00:14:16,497 --> 00:14:17,237
Yes.

298
00:14:17,237 --> 00:14:22,227
I have to get back in shape for the All Dragons Battle.

299
00:14:22,227 --> 00:14:24,687
But you're still taking on handyman jobs.

300
00:14:24,687 --> 00:14:26,977
You're pushing yourself too hard.

301
00:14:27,387 --> 00:14:28,807
I'm sorry.

302
00:14:28,807 --> 00:14:30,267
Twelve minutes.

303
00:14:30,267 --> 00:14:30,687
Huh?

304
00:14:31,247 --> 00:14:34,337
That's how long you can ride Bahamut for right now.

305
00:14:34,337 --> 00:14:37,707
You can probably go a bit longer in a Wyvern.

306
00:14:37,707 --> 00:14:39,147
That short?!

307
00:14:39,517 --> 00:14:43,867
In truth, it's so bad, it'd be best if you
 withdrew from the tournament altogether.

308
00:14:45,207 --> 00:14:49,217
You have a lot of other things you need to worry about!

309
00:14:49,217 --> 00:14:51,057
Or have you forgotten?

310
00:14:51,057 --> 00:14:52,707
I haven't.

311
00:14:52,707 --> 00:14:54,327
Hayes and Fugil.

312
00:14:54,327 --> 00:14:57,377
And the Empire's Dagger.

313
00:14:57,377 --> 00:14:58,797
You called?

314
00:14:59,957 --> 00:15:03,637
At last we meet, Prince Lux Arcadia.

315
00:15:04,427 --> 00:15:06,687
Could she really be the Empire's Dagger?!

316
00:15:06,687 --> 00:15:07,597
Run away, Lux!

317
00:15:07,597 --> 00:15:09,227
You can't fight her now!

318
00:15:09,827 --> 00:15:13,937
I've been looking forward to meeting you, Master.

319
00:15:13,937 --> 00:15:14,897
Huh?!

320
00:15:15,857 --> 00:15:18,817
My name is Kirihime Yoruka.

321
00:15:18,817 --> 00:15:23,867
I'm a Drag-Knight who used
 to serve the imperial family.

322
00:15:24,957 --> 00:15:26,697
Have you come to kill me?

323
00:15:26,697 --> 00:15:28,267
Perish the thought.

324
00:15:29,877 --> 00:15:35,227
I came here with the honest desire to serve you, master.

325
00:15:37,207 --> 00:15:39,757
To grant your desires.

326
00:15:39,757 --> 00:15:41,967
To be tool at your beck and call.

327
00:15:41,967 --> 00:15:49,967
My only wish is that you use me till my blood runs cold and my body decays.

328
00:15:49,967 --> 00:15:52,557
M-Miss Yoruka...

329
00:15:53,767 --> 00:15:55,517
Please, just call me Yoruka.

330
00:15:56,057 --> 00:15:59,857
I'm your servant, and also a year younger.

331
00:16:00,757 --> 00:16:03,507
So do you have orders for me?

332
00:16:03,507 --> 00:16:05,197
O-Orders?

333
00:16:05,197 --> 00:16:13,247
Assassinations. Chores.
 You can use me any way you want.

334
00:16:13,687 --> 00:16:16,587
A-Any way?

335
00:16:17,207 --> 00:16:18,477
Lux!

336
00:16:18,477 --> 00:16:20,047
Stay focused!

337
00:16:20,047 --> 00:16:23,197
N-No, I wasn't looking anywhere!

338
00:16:23,197 --> 00:16:27,387
Please, Master, give me my first order.

339
00:16:28,467 --> 00:16:31,337
No. Let's talk again later.

340
00:16:32,657 --> 00:16:35,297
I'd like you to wait until I have more time.

341
00:16:36,767 --> 00:16:40,857
If those are your orders, I shall comply.

342
00:16:40,857 --> 00:16:41,567
Excuse me.

343
00:16:47,947 --> 00:16:49,967
Please don't let your guard down.

344
00:16:50,737 --> 00:16:51,697
Okay.

345
00:16:51,697 --> 00:16:55,457
But look, she's doing what I told her.

346
00:16:56,167 --> 00:16:59,777
I guess I'll have her wait until the All Dragons Battle is over.

347
00:17:07,437 --> 00:17:09,637
<i>That was naive of me!</i>

348
00:17:09,637 --> 00:17:12,567
Wh-Why are you in here, Yoruka?

349
00:17:12,567 --> 00:17:16,597
I thought I'd wash your back, master.

350
00:17:19,657 --> 00:17:22,147
You don't need to show restraint.

351
00:17:22,627 --> 00:17:26,737
I know how to treat a man after his long day's work.

352
00:17:27,077 --> 00:17:29,197
Stop!

353
00:17:29,617 --> 00:17:30,117
What's wrong?!

354
00:17:30,117 --> 00:17:30,577
What happened?!

355
00:17:30,577 --> 00:17:31,157
What? What?

356
00:17:31,157 --> 00:17:32,157
Yes.

357
00:17:35,427 --> 00:17:37,327
Lux...

358
00:17:37,327 --> 00:17:38,607
You're the worst.

359
00:17:40,377 --> 00:17:42,997
In the bath house again!

360
00:17:42,997 --> 00:17:45,337
It's not what it looks like!

361
00:17:47,517 --> 00:17:49,547
What do you wish to speak about?

362
00:17:49,547 --> 00:17:52,177
Would you like to continue what we started in the bath house?

363
00:17:52,747 --> 00:17:54,637
Not at all.

364
00:17:54,637 --> 00:17:58,017
Do you know how hard it was
 to calm them down afterwards?

365
00:17:58,407 --> 00:18:03,337
You only had to say the word, 
and they'd have never bothered you again.

366
00:18:04,417 --> 00:18:05,857
Yoruka.

367
00:18:06,567 --> 00:18:09,667
Why are you so devoted to serving me?

368
00:18:10,927 --> 00:18:12,767
I looked into your past.

369
00:18:13,757 --> 00:18:18,087
You were once a Drag-Knight from a kingdom 
that the former empire conquered.

370
00:18:18,087 --> 00:18:22,497
Then you made a pact with my father and joined the imperial army, right?

371
00:18:22,497 --> 00:18:24,177
That's right.

372
00:18:24,177 --> 00:18:28,567
To put it simply, that's my story.

373
00:18:28,567 --> 00:18:30,627
But my father is dead.

374
00:18:30,627 --> 00:18:32,987
You don't need to adhere to that pact.

375
00:18:33,927 --> 00:18:37,737
I gave my everything to the empire.

376
00:18:37,737 --> 00:18:42,267
As long as any piece of it remains,
 I intend to fight.

377
00:18:42,697 --> 00:18:44,477
May I also ask a question?

378
00:18:45,377 --> 00:18:48,947
How long do you intend on deceiving those girls?

379
00:18:48,947 --> 00:18:51,527
Wh-What do you mean?

380
00:18:51,527 --> 00:18:53,857
Exactly what I said.

381
00:18:53,857 --> 00:19:02,077
With your power, you can destroy this kingdom and reconstitute the empire.

382
00:19:02,757 --> 00:19:04,747
You're joking, right?

383
00:19:04,747 --> 00:19:09,337
Of course, I don't mind you playing the long game.

384
00:19:09,337 --> 00:19:14,177
But can you swear to me here and now?

385
00:19:14,537 --> 00:19:19,287
That you'll eventually destroy this kingdom
 and restore the Arcadia Empire?

386
00:19:23,897 --> 00:19:27,437
I'm sorry, but I have no such plans.

387
00:19:28,607 --> 00:19:30,897
Are you serious about that?

388
00:19:39,537 --> 00:19:41,537
Wind is coming.

389
00:19:49,417 --> 00:19:50,567
Celes?!

390
00:19:50,567 --> 00:19:51,877
Stand back!

391
00:19:53,397 --> 00:19:54,717
She's dangerous!

392
00:19:56,117 --> 00:19:57,927
Summoning without a chant?

393
00:19:57,927 --> 00:20:01,177
You're pretty good, I guess.

394
00:20:01,177 --> 00:20:02,687
Then I'll join you.

395
00:20:05,927 --> 00:20:12,107
Allow me to introduce to you, Master, my Machine Dragon, Yato-no-kami.

396
00:20:12,107 --> 00:20:14,867
So you have a Divine Raiment Machine Dragon too.

397
00:20:14,867 --> 00:20:15,697
Lux!

398
00:20:22,137 --> 00:20:26,457
Excuse us for ganging up on you,
 but we won't hold back.

399
00:20:26,457 --> 00:20:28,587
Don't be mean to Lu.

400
00:20:28,587 --> 00:20:31,417
Good grief.

401
00:20:35,607 --> 00:20:36,967
Caught you.

402
00:20:43,257 --> 00:20:45,767
Hey! What was that, you klutz?!

403
00:20:45,767 --> 00:20:47,957
Are you trying to shoot down your allies?!

404
00:20:47,957 --> 00:20:48,687
Huh?

405
00:20:52,787 --> 00:20:54,677
Why is my Legion doing that?!

406
00:20:54,677 --> 00:20:55,687
Be careful!

407
00:20:55,687 --> 00:20:58,157
It seems she can control other Machine Dragons!

408
00:20:58,517 --> 00:21:02,367
Well, let's leave it at that for tonight.

409
00:21:02,367 --> 00:21:07,547
Master, we shall speak about this matter again.

410
00:21:07,547 --> 00:21:09,497
Are you serious about that?

411
00:21:09,497 --> 00:21:12,757
My loyalty won't waver.

412
00:21:12,757 --> 00:21:18,867
As proof, if you come with me,
 I'll tell you a very special secret.

413
00:21:18,867 --> 00:21:22,617
About a certain project which may decide this kingdom's fate.

414
00:21:22,617 --> 00:21:24,097
What project?

415
00:21:25,387 --> 00:21:30,567
I'm looking forward to our next meeting, Master.

416
00:21:34,507 --> 00:21:36,397
It can camouflage too?

417
00:21:36,397 --> 00:21:38,487
She'll be hard to deal with.

418
00:21:40,677 --> 00:21:42,037
<i>Yoruka...</i>

